{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-sample/src/messages/tests/wire.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T21:46:41.244881Z","id":"1f11469c79e44beadf5a620ea9430d5a21b05105340badcf68277cba25d0e80a","body":{"detail":"OpenRouter and others may put usage in the finish_reason chunk itself or (rarely) before it; Translator::apply emits the stop message_delta with usage {} and then the usage message_delta, and Usage::merge keeps billed_micro_usd across a later usage without it. None of those orders, nor a later usage chunk lacking cost, is tested; a regression that overwrote billed_micro_usd with None on an empty usage would pass.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":208},"end":{"line":250},"content_hash":"32565cc3490defe2a61015912d0e87bdcad6649b8b6ed74cba0704a66f131992"},"suggested_fix":"Add cases with usage (and cost) in the same chunk as finish_reason and in a chunk before it, and a stream with two usage chunks where only the first carries cost, asserting billed_micro_usd survives.","summary":"The billed-cost test only sends usage in a chunk after finish_reason","tags":["tests","session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-sample/src/messages/tests/wire.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-01T21:49:22.311501Z","id":"84fbfb777c05c68778c8636d4849757942dee6eefe7506eedc8ee81d62790bf9","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:d1c89e455","summary":"messages::tests::wire::the_billed_cost_is_read_wherever_the_usage_comes_and_kept_by_a_later_one covers usage in the finish chunk, before it, and a later usage without cost; passes (bazel test //crates/clax-sample/... passed (88 passed; 0 failed))","supersedes":"1f11469c79e44beadf5a620ea9430d5a21b05105340badcf68277cba25d0e80a","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:f97e2315-5ffc-47c7-94a0-050e4e7b9835"]}}
